## Order I'd actually work in

1. GoReSym symbol grep → learn which decoder and whether `FindResource` is called
2. Dump `.rsrc` with entropy → check for RCDATA/custom types
3. Overlay check, minus the signature blob
4. Validating signature carve across the whole file
5. Windowed entropy for headerless/encrypted plateaus
6. Slice-header pivot on each candidate → Ghidra xrefs → the consuming function

Steps 1 and 2 resolve most samples in about five minutes. If you can paste the resource dump output or the section table, I can help you read it.
